{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05331","headline":"奉和幸上官昭容院献诗四首 四 · 郑愔","name":"奉和幸上官昭容院献诗四首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"槎流天上转，茅宇禁中开。\n河鹊填桥至，山熊避槛来。\n庭花采菉蓐，岩石步莓苔。\n愿奉舆图泰，长开锦翰裁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05331.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05331","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}